{"id":"67654043764cc31b","group":"72","path":"72/72-ex-forall-eigenvariable-countermodel.md","title":"省略全称右规则新鲜性的二点反模型","display":"ex-forall-eigenvariable-countermodel — 省略全称右规则新鲜性的二点反模型","type":"example","metadata":{"type":"example","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-ex-forall-eigenvariable-countermodel","aliases":["72-ex-forall-eigenvariable-countermodel"],"display":"ex-forall-eigenvariable-countermodel — 省略全称右规则新鲜性的二点反模型","depends_on":["[[72-df-eigenvariable]]","[[72-df-sequent-validity]]"],"chapter":"I","source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Ch.I §2.3.2 eigenvariable condition, print32/PDF44; local explicit countermodel","source_kind":"source-based-local-formalization","verification_status":"source-statement-and-local-contract-reviewed; not-machine-checked","proof_status":"explicit two-element structure calculation checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"created":"2026-10-22","revision_round":"2026-10-22-expansion"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"example"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-ex-forall-eigenvariable-countermodel"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-ex-forall-eigenvariable-countermodel</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"ex-forall-eigenvariable-countermodel — 省略全称右规则新鲜性的二点反模型"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"22825d76e4968201\" href=\"?note=22825d76e4968201\" title=\"72-df-eigenvariable\">72-df-eigenvariable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ba1b086fe1d56f25\" href=\"?note=ba1b086fe1d56f25\" title=\"72-df-sequent-validity\">72-df-sequent-validity</a></span></div>"},{"key":"chapter","html":"I"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Ch.I §2.3.2 eigenvariable condition, print32/PDF44; local explicit countermodel"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"source-based-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-and-local-contract-reviewed; not-machine-checked"},{"key":"proof_status","html":"explicit two-element structure calculation checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"created","html":"2026-10-22"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"2026-10-22-expansion"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Σ 仅有一元关系 P、无常元和函数；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak M=\\langle\\{0,1\\},\\varnothing,\\varnothing,\\{\\langle P,\\{\\langle0\\rangle\\}\\rangle\\}\\rangle\">\\(\\mathfrak M=\\langle\\{0,1\\},\\varnothing,\\varnothing,\\{\\langle P,\\{\\langle0\\rangle\\}\\rangle\\}\\rangle\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\eta\">\\(\\eta\\)</span> 将全部对象变量赋为0，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x:=v_1,y:=v_0\">\\(x:=v_1,y:=v_0\\)</span>。Eigen 与相继式语义取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"22825d76e4968201\" href=\"?note=22825d76e4968201\" title=\"72-df-eigenvariable\">72-df-eigenvariable</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"ba1b086fe1d56f25\" href=\"?note=ba1b086fe1d56f25\" title=\"72-df-sequent-validity\">72-df-sequent-validity</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak M,\\eta\\models_{\\rm seq}\\langle\\langle P(y)\\rangle,\\langle P(y)\\rangle\\rangle,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathfrak M,\\eta\\models_{\\rm seq}\\langle\\langle P(y)\\rangle,\\langle P(y)\\rangle\\rangle,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\neg\\bigl(\\mathfrak M,\\eta\\models_{\\rm seq}\\langle\\langle P(y)\\rangle,\\langle\\forall xP(x)\\rangle\\rangle\\bigr),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\neg\\bigl(\\mathfrak M,\\eta\\models_{\\rm seq}\\langle\\langle P(y)\\rangle,\\langle\\forall xP(x)\\rangle\\rangle\\bigr),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\neg\\operatorname{Eigen}(y;\\langle P(y)\\rangle,\\langle\\rangle,\\forall xP(x)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\neg\\operatorname{Eigen}(y;\\langle P(y)\\rangle,\\langle\\rangle,\\forall xP(x)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>前提是恒等相继式；结论的前件 P(0) 为真，而全称式在元素1处失败。y 出现在未解除前件中，正是 Eigen 条件排除的情形。这个有限模型测试检验旁条件的实际作用，不以“通常要求新鲜”替代数学反例。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-eigenvariable","status":"resolved","id":"22825d76e4968201","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-eigenvariable]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-sequent-validity","status":"resolved","id":"ba1b086fe1d56f25","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-sequent-validity]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-eigenvariable","status":"resolved","id":"22825d76e4968201","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"Σ 仅有一元关系 P、无常元和函数；$\\mathfrak M=\\langle\\{0,1\\},\\varnothing,\\varnothing,\\{\\langle P,\\{\\langle0\\rangle\\}\\rangle\\}\\rangle$。$\\eta$ 将全部对象变量赋为0，$x:=v_1,y:=v_0$。Eigen 与相继式语义取 [[72-df-eigenvariable]]、[[72-df-sequent-validity]]。","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-sequent-validity","status":"resolved","id":"ba1b086fe1d56f25","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"Σ 仅有一元关系 P、无常元和函数；$\\mathfrak M=\\langle\\{0,1\\},\\varnothing,\\varnothing,\\{\\langle P,\\{\\langle0\\rangle\\}\\rangle\\}\\rangle$。$\\eta$ 将全部对象变量赋为0，$x:=v_1,y:=v_0$。Eigen 与相继式语义取 [[72-df-eigenvariable]]、[[72-df-sequent-validity]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathfrak M=\\langle\\{0,1\\},\\varnothing,\\varnothing,\\{\\langle P,\\{\\langle0\\rangle\\}\\rangle\\}\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"\\eta","display":false},{"tex":"x:=v_1,y:=v_0","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathfrak M,\\eta\\models_{\\rm seq}\\langle\\langle P(y)\\rangle,\\langle P(y)\\rangle\\rangle,","display":true},{"tex":"\\neg\\bigl(\\mathfrak M,\\eta\\models_{\\rm seq}\\langle\\langle P(y)\\rangle,\\langle\\forall xP(x)\\rangle\\rangle\\bigr),","display":true},{"tex":"\\neg\\operatorname{Eigen}(y;\\langle P(y)\\rangle,\\langle\\rangle,\\forall xP(x)).","display":true}],"bytes":1805,"backlinks":[{"id":"e6c99e2646691c7d","anchor":"ref-104","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"I章新增5项：[[72-df-first-order-craig-interpolant]] · [[72-df-first-order-formula-vocabulary]] · [[72-ex-forall-eigenvariable-countermodel]] · [[72-thm-first-order-craig-interpolation]] · [[72-thm-partitioned-sequent-interpolation]]"},{"id":"00439897fba390aa","anchor":"ref-478","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"I章新增5项：[[72-df-first-order-craig-interpolant]] · [[72-df-first-order-formula-vocabulary]] · [[72-ex-forall-eigenvariable-countermodel]] · [[72-thm-first-order-craig-interpolation]] · [[72-thm-partitioned-sequent-interpolation]]"},{"id":"70ff58eeae2491db","anchor":"ref-473","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"I章新增5项：[[72-df-first-order-craig-interpolant]] · [[72-df-first-order-formula-vocabulary]] · [[72-ex-forall-eigenvariable-countermodel]] · [[72-thm-first-order-craig-interpolation]] · [[72-thm-partitioned-sequent-interpolation]]"},{"id":"6aa9c9e25ba49583","anchor":"ref-101","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"I章新增5项：[[72-df-first-order-craig-interpolant]] · [[72-df-first-order